  unitName: Plein Flair Auberi
  unitId: 820718
  unitNumber: 8516
  description: "A gentle, soft-spoken painter from the strange world of Paskua who
    lives in a lonely wing of a royal castle. Despite his shyness, Auberi is always
    eager to share his thoughts and feelings on art with kindred souls. Though hardly
    anyone has seen this elusive painter, his friendship with the royal sorcerer
    and the fact that several servants regularly attend to him prove he is not just
    a simple guest.Along with Marianne, the dutiful royal guard who first stumbled
    upon the Crystals, Auberi managed to unravel the mystery of their rituals, culminating
    in the appearance of the most legendary among them\u2014the fabled Rainbow Crystal.
    Its wondrous voice was filled with kindness as it encouraged the young painter
    to pursue his dream of creating art so evocative they moved hearts and touched
    souls. With its generous blessing and several days' worth of collected material,
    Auberi was finally able to create enough Rainbow Paint to complete his masterpiece...a
    portrait of the royal family. Notably, the portrait includes Auberi himself.The
    king's only son, the mysterious prince who had shied away from public appearance
    for years...was Auberi all along."
  summonDesc: When I finish painting,<br>I'm usually as surprised as anyone else.<br>Life
    is full of wonder, isn't it?
  fusionDesc: Hehe. You're too nice!<br>Why don't you stay awhile?<br>I'll paint
    a nice portrait of you.
  evoDesc: Hmm...That'll do it.<br>My masterpiece is finally complete!<br>It's all
    thanks to you.
  element: 2
  rarity: 7
